  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRRS Chad 2025 &#x2013; UNICEF WASH WG coordinator</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Water, Sanitation and Hygiene Working Group (WASH WG) coordinator (UNICEF) will provide leadership and representation of the WG at sub-national level. He or she will facilitate the processes that will ensure a well-coordinated, strategic, adequate, coherent, and effective response by participants in the sub-national Working Group that is accountable to those who are affected by the emergency. In their effort to provide an efficient and effective response to the humanitarian crisis, the WASH WG coordinator is responsible for building relationships with stakeholders, for securing the overall coordination of sectoral responses and for ensuring inter-sectoral collaboration at the sub-national level and for ensuring adequate coordination with the national level.</narrative>
  </description>
